{"id":220,"date":"2021-09-18T10:33:47","date_gmt":"2021-09-18T08:33:47","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/?page_id=220"},"modified":"2021-09-18T15:21:08","modified_gmt":"2021-09-18T13:21:08","slug":"reference","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/reference\/","title":{"rendered":"Reference"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>[vc_row][vc_column]\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-element grve-testimonial grve-with-gap grve-layout-3 grve-isotope reference\" style=\"\" data-columns=\"3\" data-columns-large-screen=\"4\" data-columns-tablet-landscape=\"2\" data-columns-tablet-portrait=\"2\" data-columns-mobile=\"1\" data-layout=\"masonry\" data-gutter-size=\"40\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-container\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item grve-testimonial-item post-218 testimonial type-testimonial status-publish hentry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item-inner \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-element grve-box-item grve-bg-none\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Nikdo do m\u011b nedostal tolik znalost\u00ed a\u00a0poznatk\u016f s\u00a0t\u00edm, \u017ee by ve m\u011b z\u016fstaly d\u00e9le ne\u017e do konce hodiny, v\u00a0lep\u0161\u00edm p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b do konce t\u00fddne. Z\u00a0toho co mi Al\u017eb\u011bta p\u0159edala do dne\u0161ka \u017eiju a\u00a0jsem za to neskonale vd\u011b\u010dn\u00fd. A\u017e s\u00a0odstupem \u010dasu dok\u00e1\u017eu ocenit co v\u0161e pro m\u011b osobn\u011b ud\u011blala a\u00a0co dok\u00e1zala. Mnohokr\u00e1t a\u00a0od srdce d\u011bkuji. Je sice pravda, \u017ee ne v\u017edy jsem chodil do hodin s\u00a0upln\u011b \u010dist\u00fdm sv\u011bdom\u00edm, \u017ee jsem nem\u011bl spln\u011bn\u00fd n\u011bjak\u00fd ten dom\u00e1c\u00ed \u00fakol, ale to proto, \u017ee jsem skute\u010dn\u011b cht\u011bl chodit p\u0159ipraven a\u00a0p\u0159ipravoval se na m\u00e9 pom\u011bry pe\u010dliv\u011b. Co\u017e tak\u00e9 m\u00e1lokdo p\u0159ed Al\u017eb\u011btou dok\u00e1zal ???? S\u00a0lehkost\u00ed sob\u011b vlastn\u00ed n\u00e1m vtiskla spoustu poznatk\u016f a\u00a0hlavn\u011b z\u00e1klad\u016f, na kter\u00fdch se dalo a\u00a0st\u00e1le je\u0161t\u011b d\u00e1 stav\u011bt. Hodiny m\u011b bavily, n\u011bco jsem se dozv\u011bd\u011bl, pobavil se a\u00a0m\u011blo to pro m\u011b tedy smysl.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-author\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-small-text grve-heading-color grve-testimonial-name\">Franti\u0161ek Koudelka<span class=\"grve-text-primary-1\"><\/span><\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item grve-testimonial-item post-219 testimonial type-testimonial status-publish hentry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item-inner \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-element grve-box-item grve-bg-none\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">J\u00e1 hodnot\u00edm jen kladn\u011b. Byla jsem moc r\u00e1da, \u017ee \u00a0m\u011b Al\u017eb\u011bta mohla u\u010dit a\u00a0je jen \u0161koda, \u017ee u\u017e tomu tak nen\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">V\u00fduka byla jasn\u00e1 a\u00a0srozumiteln\u00e1. Gramatiku Al\u017eb\u011bta vysv\u011btlila tak, \u017ee jsem v\u011bd\u011bla, kdy ji pou\u017e\u00edt a\u00a0pro\u010d, rozum\u011bla jsem tomu. To bylo pro m\u011b d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Pokud n\u00e1m n\u011bco ne\u0161lo, tak jsme to v\u017edy po\u0159\u00e1dn\u011b procvi\u010dili, dokud jsme to nepochopili.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">L\u00edbil se mi i\u00a0zp\u016fsob, jak\u00fdm jsme procvi\u010dovali konverzaci, u\u010dili se a\u00a0procvi\u010dovali slovn\u00ed z\u00e1sobu, \u010detli knihy.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Takov\u00fdch skv\u011bl\u00fdch u\u010ditel\u016f jsem moc nepotkala a\u00a0\u010dasto s\u00a0kolegy vzpom\u00edn\u00e1me.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-author\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-small-text grve-heading-color grve-testimonial-name\">Dana Olivov\u00e1<span class=\"grve-text-primary-1\"><\/span><\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item grve-testimonial-item post-230 testimonial type-testimonial status-publish hentry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item-inner \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-element grve-box-item grve-bg-none\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Jsem velmi r\u00e1d, \u017ee mohu sd\u011blit sv\u00e9 pocity z\u00a0v\u00fduky AJ, kterou pro n\u00e1s s\u00a0kolegy Al\u017eb\u011bta zaji\u0161\u0165ovala. V\u011b\u0159\u00edm, \u017ee budu mluvit za v\u00edce sv\u00fdch koleg\u016f se kter\u00fdmi jsem do jej\u00edch hodin chodil. Hrozn\u011b moc \u010dasto na Al\u017eb\u011btu vzpom\u00edn\u00e1me. My\u0161leno v\u00a0dobr\u00e9m. Al\u017eb\u011btin styl v\u00fduky a\u00a0p\u0159\u00edstup byl velmi dobr\u00fd, a\u00a0i\u00a0kdy\u017e jsme ob\u010das byli tu\u017e\u0161\u00edm materi\u00e1lem, shodli jsme se na tom, \u017ee jste n\u00e1m v\u00a0tom roce dala z\u00a0v\u00fduky nejv\u00edce ze v\u0161ech minul\u00fdch i\u00a0pozd\u011bj\u0161\u00edch u\u010ditel\u016f. Mnohokr\u00e1t jsme \u0159\u00edkali a\u00a0\u0159\u00edk\u00e1me dodnes ,,Al\u017eb\u011bta byla nejlep\u0161\u00ed\u201c. Z\u00a0toho ,co n\u00e1s nau\u010dila \u010derp\u00e1me dodnes.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-author\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-small-text grve-heading-color grve-testimonial-name\">Ji\u0159\u00ed Arno\u0161t<span class=\"grve-text-primary-1\"><\/span><\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item grve-testimonial-item post-231 testimonial type-testimonial status-publish hentry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item-inner \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-element grve-box-item grve-bg-none\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Lekce angli\u010dtiny s Al\u017eb\u011btou jsou p\u0159\u00edkladem toho, co znamen\u00e1 \u0160kola hrou \u2013 dok\u00e1\u017ee \u010dlov\u011bka nadchnout pro studium a vt\u00e1hnout ho do hodiny, tak\u017ee se v\u017edy t\u011b\u0161\u00ed na dal\u0161\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p>V\u00fdborn\u011b dok\u00e1\u017ee sv\u00e9 studenty motivovat, zam\u011b\u0159it se na jejich slab\u00e1 m\u00edsta a tato postupn\u011b vypilovat. Hodiny nejsou jednotv\u00e1rn\u00e9, vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 mnoho r\u016fzn\u00fdch v\u00fdukov\u00fdch technik, d\u00edky kter\u00fdm je jazyk opravdu pou\u017eiteln\u00fd ve skute\u010dn\u00e9m \u017eivot\u011b.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-author\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-small-text grve-heading-color grve-testimonial-name\">Pavla Frydrychov\u00e1<span class=\"grve-text-primary-1\"><\/span><\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item grve-testimonial-item post-232 testimonial type-testimonial status-publish hentry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item-inner \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-element grve-box-item grve-bg-none\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Al\u017eb\u011bta Rychteck\u00e1 \u2013 nejlep\u0161\u00ed lektorka angli\u010dtiny, kterou zn\u00e1m.<\/p>\n<p>S jej\u00ed pomoc\u00ed jsem se dostala t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 z nulov\u00e9 znalosti na slu\u0161nou komunikativn\u00ed \u00farove\u0148 za kr\u00e1tk\u00fd \u010das, a i kdy\u017e je to u\u017e n\u011bjak\u00e1 doba, co m\u011b u\u010dila, \u010derp\u00e1m z toho dodnes.<\/p>\n<p>Krom neot\u0159el\u00e9ho zp\u016fsobu jej\u00ed v\u00fduky a naprost\u00e9 profesionality, oce\u0148uji neform\u00e1ln\u00ed lidsk\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstup a p\u0159edev\u0161\u00edm nezapomenutelnou osobnost, kter\u00e1 V\u00e1s nikdy nep\u0159estane bavit.<\/p>\n<p>U n\u00e1s ve firm\u011b byla velice \u017e\u00e1dan\u00e1, v\u011bt\u0161ina student\u016f, kte\u0159\u00ed byli jednou v jej\u00edm kurzu, se t\u011b\u017eko smi\u0159ovali s t\u00edm, kdy\u017e ji dal\u0161\u00ed rok \u201enedostali\u201c.<\/p>\n<p>Za m\u011b \u2013 kde u\u010d\u00ed AJ Al\u017eb\u011bta \u2013 je to na s\u00e1zka na jistotu.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-author\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-small-text grve-heading-color grve-testimonial-name\">Nora Rotterov\u00e1<span class=\"grve-text-primary-1\"><\/span><\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item grve-testimonial-item post-233 testimonial type-testimonial status-publish hentry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-isotope-item-inner \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-element grve-box-item grve-bg-none\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Nejde jen o hodnocen\u00ed angli\u010dtiny, ale o hodnocen\u00ed Al\u017eb\u011btiny osoby jako celku.Pro m\u011b byla a st\u00e1le je velkou inspirac\u00ed a m\u00e1 m\u016fj obdiv za to jak\u00e1 je. Jsem r\u00e1da, \u017ee jsem ji mohla poznat a mohla jsem b\u00fdt jej\u00ed \u017e\u00e1kyn\u00ed.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-testimonial-author\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-small-text grve-heading-color grve-testimonial-name\">Marta S\u00fdkorov\u00e1<span class=\"grve-text-primary-1\"><\/span><\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t[\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>[vc_row][vc_column][\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-220","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/220","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=220"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/220\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":235,"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/220\/revisions\/235"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=220"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}